The repository consists of:
 - Pilot study dataset
 - Full experiment dataset
 - The Jupyter Notebook with the code analyzing the data with graphs and tables
 - The excact prompt for the models
 - Graphs and other visualization as PNG
 - Exam sets and solutions. Note that the exam sets are named 02450 as the course has changed number this year to 02451

Made by Bertram Sillesen, Noah Westheimer, Lasse Lundbaek and Vincent Vaupel
